There was a 10% chance to ruin your game this way. If the Solar had
turned out hostile, you would have been dead almost immediately. Maybe
it does not matter that early in the game...

Anyway, I consider the minimum equipment to make you ready for getting a
Solar from a figurine: 200 HP (he will take down more than 100 in one
round of melee), a wand of teleport (to teleport him away) and a
well-enchanted assault rifle and some 30 plus +4 bullets.  Then you have
a chance of surviving a hostile Solar... You can do without the two
latter items, if you immediately leave the level after teleporting him
away, not to return until you have a means to kill him. (A cockatrice
corpse would also do, but then you have to wait applying your figurine
until you have a freshly killed cockatrice.)



